$NetBSD$

Use NetBSD explicit-locale libc calls for scoped Skia shader formatting.
Preserve nested/thread ownership without changing the process locale.
This is not an implementation of POSIX uselocale for external libraries.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted); not submitted upstream.

